{"text": "When I stopped the machine at last, I found myself sitting on soft grass in a little garden, in the middle of a heavy hailstorm. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The dials on the machine told me an astonishing fact, that I had arrived in the year 802, 701. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Through the gray curtain of hail, I saw a huge white figure, which looked like a sphinx with its wings spread wide. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It stood on a bronze pedestal, and its face, which was turned toward me, seemed to wear a faint and unpleasant smile. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As the hail grew thinner, I saw great buildings rising among the trees, and a sudden fear took hold of me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What if the people of this age had become cruel and powerful, and treated me like a wild animal from the past. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In a panic I tried to set the machine upright again, ready to escape, when I saw figures coming out of a nearby building. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Never had I felt so helpless and alone as I did at that moment in that strange new world.", "alignment": {"characters": ["W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "I", " ", "s", "t", "o", "p", "p", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "c", "h", "i", "n", "e", " ", "a", "t", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", ",", " ", "I", " ", "f", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "m", "y", "s", "e", "l", "f", " ", "s", "i", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "o", "n", " ", "s", "o", "f", "t", " ", "g", "r", "a", "s", "s", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "g", "a", "r", "d", "e", "n", ",", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "i", "d", "d", "l", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "a", " ", "h", "e", "a", "v", "y", " ", "h", "a", "i", "l", "s", "t", "o", "r", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "d", "i", "a", "l", "s", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "c", "h", "i", "n", "e", " ", "t", "o", "l", "d", "